<title>USA: RenaissanceRe sets secondary offering price.</title>
<headline>RenaissanceRe sets secondary offering price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>RenaissanceRe Holdings Ltd said it has priced a secondary public offering of 3 million common shares at $38.00 per share.</p>
<p>All of the shares being offered are owned by the company's founding institutional shareholders or their successors. The company said it will not receive any of the proceeds of the offering.</p>
<p>RenaissanceRe said it purchased for cancellation an aggregate of 700,000 common shares. The company purchase will reduce outstanding shares to about 22.1 million.</p>
<p>RenaissanceRe provides reinsurance and insurance.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
